    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294540/extras/48a9d0baba472506299fc253aa7f04e4.avif?t=1731663057\" width=768 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[MazeTD] is a tower defense game where the attack power of the arrow tower is slightly insufficient. You need to build a maze around the waypoints, allowing the animals to slowly navigate through the maze to give the arrow tower more attack time and eliminate them in the maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Click on the ground and create a stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Click on the stone and upgrade to one of the four types of arrow towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Click on the Arrow Tower and continue upgrading it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. WSAD mobile perspective, zoom in and out of the map with the mouse wheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stone and arrow tower form a maze, and the animals have no attacking power. They will start from their birth point, reach waypoint 1, then waypoint 2,... reach waypoint N, and finally reach the endpoint.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294540/extras/48a9d0baba472506299fc253aa7f04e4.avif?t=1731663057\" width=768 height=432 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[MazeTD] is a tower defense game where the attack power of the arrow tower is slightly insufficient. You need to build a maze around the waypoints, allowing the animals to slowly navigate through the maze to give the arrow tower more attack time and eliminate them in the maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Click on the ground and create a stone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Click on the stone and upgrade to one of the four types of arrow towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Click on the Arrow Tower and continue upgrading it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. WSAD mobile perspective, zoom in and out of the map with the mouse wheel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stone and arrow tower form a maze, and the animals have no attacking power. They will start from their birth point, reach waypoint 1, then waypoint 2,... reach waypoint N, and finally reach the endpoint.</p>",
    "short_description": "[MazeTD] is a tower defense game where the attack power of the arrow tower is slightly insufficient. You need to build a maze around the waypoints, allowing the animals to slowly navigate through the maze to give the arrow tower more attack time and eliminate them in the maze.",
